   "id": "quest:weald:p001",
   "name": "Fungal Research",
   "level": 1,
   "restPoints": 8,
   "printedLines": [
    "{icon:56ea9289ab} I",
    "8 Fungal Research",
    "The weald is a mysterious place,",
    "thus we know so little of its",
    "denizens and plants. Rumor has it that a",
    "mysterious type of fungus grows in its dark",
    "crevasses. Thus, you need to collect as many",
    "samples as you can to be tested. We only",
    "hope that they give us further insight as to",
    "what we have to combat.",
    "SPECIAL RULES",
    "Objective Rooms are rooms {icon:497092fe1f} 3 ,",
    "{icon:497092fe1f} 6 & {icon:497092fe1f} 8 . Upon entering, randomly",
    "choose one and discard it once secured.",
    "Win Battles there with at least",
    "one unsmashed Necrotic Fungus",
    "to gain the objective.",
    "XP",
    "1 Xp/ Necrotic Fungus brought back.",
    "{icon:d3a3e38ee9} 3 {icon:6f701b5f5f} 1",
    "{icon:af3ce426ec} 1 {icon:67dc216fc3} 1 {icon:e7b30e2005} 2"
   ],
