   "name": "Disinfection",
   "level": 1,
   "restPoints": 8,
   "printedLines": [
    "{icon:56ea9289ab} I",
    "8 Disinfection",
    "Not even the vegetation of the",
    "Weald can stand against the",
    "seeping corruption of the evil that",
    "lives deep in its groves. Majestic oaks have",
    "been tainted, but they can still be saved. Take",
    "potions and pour them onto their roots. Let",
    "the healing magic undo what the dreadful",
    "darkness has done to these majestic trees.",
    "SPECIAL RULES",
    "Objective Room is always room {icon:497092fe1f} 5 .",
    "Start this Quest with 3 additional",
    "{icon:008373e459} Provisions. A Hero must",
    "spend one action and a {icon:008373e459} when",
    "in Area {icon:401040514c} of the Objective",
    "Room to disinfect the oak.",
    "XP",
    "1 Xp/ Oak disinfected.",
