   "name": "Patrol the Woods",
   "level": 1,
   "restPoints": 8,
   "printedLines": [
    "{icon:56ea9289ab} I",
    "8 Patrol the Woods",
    "People are afraid of the Weald",
    "as it stands dark, foreboding",
    "and unwelcoming. We need light, we need",
    "you. Traverse the dark groves and look out",
    "for the danger that lurks within its foliage.",
    "Eradicate the monsters and ensure that we",
    "sleep yet one more night…",
    "SPECIAL RULES",
    "When Battle starts, roll a {icon:bc73e13882} . If you",
    "rolled over your {icon:806b25ecac} Level, place all",
    "Monster Initiative Cards on top of the",
    "deck for the first round of Battle.",
